//! The object-op dispatch and the trap handler (spec §3, §5.7).
//!
//! Handle-table lookup, object type, op table, rights check, op, and then every
//! op body the object kinds have. This is the top of the kernel: an op may
//! reach any seam below it, and nothing below may reach an op.
//!
//! `ktrap` is the HAL's landing point for every trap taken from user mode, and
//! the frame it returns is the whole of the context switch.

